{{also|Fides}}
==Latin==

===Etymology 1===
From {{proto|Indo-European|bʰidʰ-|lang=la}}, [[zero-grade]] of {{proto|Indo-European|bʰeydʰ-|to command, to persuade, to trust|lang=la}}.
Cognate to Latin {{term|fido|fīdō|I trust|lang=la}} and {{proto|Germanic|bīdanan|lang=}}.

====Noun====
{{la-noun|fidēs|fidei|fideī|f|fifth}}

# [[faith]], [[belief]]
# [[reliance]]
# [[confidence]], [[trust]]

=====Inflection=====
{{la-decl-5th|fid}}

